---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us • Teer Result Live"
  description="About Teer Result Live - India's fastest autonomous traditional Meghalaya archery reporting portal."
>
  <div class="bg-white border border-slate-200/90 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-slate-700 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-xs sm:text-sm shadow-xs">
    <h1 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-slate-900">About Teer Result Live</h1>
    
    <p>
      <strong>Teer Result Live (<a href="https://teerresultlive.in" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">teerresultlive.in</a>)</strong> is a dedicated independent news publication portal that reports the outcomes of traditional archery sporting contests conducted in the state of Meghalaya, India.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Our Mission</h2>
    <p>
      Our mission is to deliver fast, authentic, and accurate First Round (FR) and Second Round (SR) archery numbers to enthusiasts, journalists, and researchers across the globe. Our platform uses edge computing technology to stream results within seconds of verification from the archery grounds.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Traditional Archery in Meghalaya</h2>
    <p>
      Teer is an ancient Khasi tradition. Under the <em>Meghalaya Amusements and Betting Tax (Amendment) Act 1982</em>, the game is conducted under state regulatory oversight by the Khasi Hills Archery Sports Association (KHASA) at the Polo Ground in Shillong.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 pt-2">Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      For media inquiries, corrections, or feedback, you can reach our editorial desk at <a href="mailto:contact@teerresultlive.in" class="text-amber-700 font-semibold hover:underline">contact@teerresultlive.in</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
